[gd_scene load_steps=35 format=3]

; Rest-site (campfire) model for Yetannia -- animated flipbook.
; Generated by .tools/build-alt-scenes.py -- do not hand-edit; retune the script instead.
;
; BASE-LIB CONTRACT: the root is a Node2D (so its Scale survives conversion) whose children are
; re-parented onto a generated NRestSiteCharacter; 'ControlRoot' and 'Hitbox' below are
; mandatory. POSITION/ROOT-OFFSET ARE AN APPROXIMATION: the source data has no sitting clip, so
; this plays the standing idle. Nothing in the game drives an NRestSiteCharacter's animation
; (CustomAnimationPatch is wired to NCreature only), which is why the AnimationPlayer uses
; autoplay rather than a trigger.
;
; The atlas is the SAME texture the in-combat flipbook uses, so this scene adds no texture memory;
; it only adds AtlasTexture regions and an Animation.

